"""Task module: reaching in a robot-generated force field (curl fields on a planar manipulandum), one row per trial, with the two
trial-wise learning measures the authors computed: the maximum perpendicular error of field and null trials and the force
compensation of channel trials. First defined with Yeo2015_PLoSOne (dual adaptation to opposing curl fields in three coordinate
frames). Datasets that share the hand paths themselves belong in the reach90 or timeseries formats instead."""

DESCRIPTION = ("Reaching in a force field: one row per trial. Null and field trials carry the maximum perpendicular error; "
               "channel trials (the hand is guided along a straight mechanical channel) carry the force compensation, the "
               "percentage of the field's force the person pushed against the channel wall.")

# (column, type, values or units, description)
